  "cue_count": 82,
  "cues": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "start": 1.55,
      "end": 4.55,
      "text": "These 10 people represent everyone in America.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.127124,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.079041
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "start": 4.55,
      "end": 9.55,
      "text": "This person on the left, she represents the poorest 10% of Americans.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.127124,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.079041
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "start": 9.55,
      "end": 12.55,
      "text": "And on the right, he is the very richest 10%.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.127124,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.079041
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "start": 12.55,
      "end": 15.55,
      "text": "So let's ask this group a simple question.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.127124,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.079041
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "start": 15.55,
      "end": 18.55,
      "text": "What percentage of your income gets taxed?",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.127124,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.079041
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "start": 18.55,
      "end": 21.55,
      "text": "Most Americans pay multiple income taxes to the federal government",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.127124,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.079041
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "start": 21.55,
      "end": 24.55,
      "text": "and state governments and local governments.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.127124,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.079041
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "start": 24.55,
      "end": 28.55,
      "text": "But a recent analysis by two economists added up all the income taxes.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.127124,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.079041
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "start": 28.55,
      "end": 33.55,
      "text": "And when you do that, the data shows that poor people pay a very small part of their income to the government.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.045618,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.006287
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "start": 33.55,
      "end": 35.55,
      "text": "And rich people pay more.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.045618,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.006287
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "start": 35.55,
      "end": 39.55,
      "text": "This concept of taxing the poor at a lower rate and taxing the rich more,",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.045618,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.006287
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "start": 39.55,
      "end": 41.55,
      "text": "this is called progressive taxation.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.045618,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.006287
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "start": 41.55,
      "end": 43.55,
      "text": "It's how taxes work in most countries.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.045618,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.006287
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "start": 43.55,
      "end": 48.55,
      "text": "But it's also why some critics question whether these people are getting away without paying their fair share.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.045618,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.006287
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "start": 48.55,
      "end": 53.55,
      "text": "The middle class and the poor that pay, if anything, a lot less.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.045618,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.006287
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "start": 53.55,
      "end": 59.55,
      "text": "What is it that 45% of the population of this country is not contributing back to the rest?",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.085804,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.003376
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "start": 59.55,
      "end": 62.55,
      "text": "But now let's add one more guy to this group of 10.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.085804,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.003376
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "start": 62.55,
      "end": 63.55,
      "text": "This guy?",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.085804,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.003376
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "start": 63.55,
      "end": 67.55,
      "text": "He represents the 400 richest Americans, billionaires.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.085804,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.003376
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "start": 67.55,
      "end": 70.55,
      "text": "Billionaires don't make most of their money through typical income.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.085804,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.003376
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "start": 70.55,
      "end": 74.55,
      "text": "So their income actually gets taxed at lower rates than these less rich people.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.085804,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.003376
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "start": 74.55,
      "end": 78.55,
      "text": "Now you might be thinking, don't billionaires pay taxes in other ways?",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.085804,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.003376
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "start": 78.55,
      "end": 79.55,
      "text": "And the answer is yes.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.085804,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.003376
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "start": 79.55,
      "end": 83.55,
      "text": "This is just the income tax, and there are lots of other kinds of taxes in America.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.048035,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.007812
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "start": 83.55,
      "end": 88.55,
      "text": "And this analysis, where this data came from, it looked at all those taxes.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.048035,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.007812
    },
    {
      "index": 25,
      "start": 88.55,
      "end": 95.55,
      "text": "And it shows that when we add them all up, there actually is someone in this group who might not be paying their fair share.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.048035,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.007812
    },
    {
      "index": 26,
      "start": 95.55,
      "end": 103.2,
      "text": "Let's go back to our first chart with these 11 people.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.048035,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.007812
    },
    {
      "index": 27,
      "start": 103.2,
      "end": 105.2,
      "text": "Remember, this is just the income tax.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.048035,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.007812
    },
    {
      "index": 28,
      "start": 105.2,
      "end": 108.2,
      "text": "What happens when we add in all the other taxes?",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.048035,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.007812
    },
    {
      "index": 29,
      "start": 108.2,
      "end": 112.2,
      "text": "Well, let's look at another kind of tax, corporate and property taxes.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.048035,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.007812
    },
    {
      "index": 30,
      "start": 112.2,
      "end": 117.2,
      "text": "One of the taxes we pay on things we own, usually businesses and property, and the money we make on them.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.07877,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.011688
    },
    {
      "index": 31,
      "start": 117.2,
      "end": 123.2,
      "text": "Usually rich people own more things, so these corporate and property taxes hit them the hardest.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.07877,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.011688
    },
    {
      "index": 32,
      "start": 123.2,
      "end": 130.2,
      "text": "Rich people also tend to be from rich families, and when they inherit a lot of money, the government taxes them.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.07877,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.011688
    },
    {
      "index": 33,
      "start": 130.2,
      "end": 132.2,
      "text": "This is called an estate tax.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.07877,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.011688
    },
    {
      "index": 34,
      "start": 132.2,
      "end": 138.2,
      "text": "Put these taxes together, and it's clear that they place a much heavier burden on the rich, including billionaires.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.07877,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.011688
    },
    {
      "index": 35,
      "start": 138.2,
      "end": 144.2,
      "text": "Add these back onto the income taxes, and it looks like the rich really do pay way more than the poor.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.069271,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.002981
    },
    {
      "index": 36,
      "start": 144.2,
      "end": 147.2,
      "text": "But now let's talk about another tax.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.069271,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.002981
    },
    {
      "index": 37,
      "start": 147.2,
      "end": 149.2,
      "text": "This one's buried in your pay stub.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.069271,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.002981
    },
    {
      "index": 38,
      "start": 149.2,
      "end": 153.2,
      "text": "Look closely and you'll see something called a Medicare tax and a Social Security tax.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.069271,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.002981
    },
    {
      "index": 39,
      "start": 153.2,
      "end": 155.2,
      "text": "Sometimes paystubs call them FICA.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.069271,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.002981
    },
    {
      "index": 40,
      "start": 155.2,
      "end": 158.2,
      "text": "Anyway, combined, these are called payroll taxes.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.069271,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.002981
    },
    {
      "index": 41,
      "start": 158.2,
      "end": 161.2,
      "text": "Medicare and Social Security are two really important programs.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.069271,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.002981
    },
    {
      "index": 42,
      "start": 161.2,
      "end": 164.2,
      "text": "They provide healthcare and a modest income for when we get old and retire.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.069271,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.002981
    },
    {
      "index": 43,
      "start": 164.2,
      "end": 170.2,
      "text": "But they're also expensive, which is why we have these payroll taxes separate from the income tax to pay for them.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.063053,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.136475
    },
    {
      "index": 44,
      "start": 170.2,
      "end": 179.2,
      "text": "So on your paycheck, you'll notice that your tax is 7.65% in payroll taxes, and your company is supposed to pay another 7.65% on your behalf.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.063053,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.136475
    },
    {
      "index": 45,
      "start": 179.2,
      "end": 186.2,
      "text": "But economists have found that in practice, the way companies pay their part of the payroll tax is by just paying workers less.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.063053,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.136475
    },
    {
      "index": 46,
      "start": 186.2,
      "end": 191.2,
      "text": "So in reality, many workers pay nearly the full 15.3% toward this tax.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.063053,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.136475
    },
    {
      "index": 47,
      "start": 191.2,
      "end": 194.2,
      "text": "And everyone is on the hook for the same percentage.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.051813,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.00255
    },
    {
      "index": 48,
      "start": 194.2,
      "end": 197.2,
      "text": "But they're wealthy?",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.051813,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.00255
    },
    {
      "index": 49,
      "start": 197.2,
      "end": 204.2,
      "text": "Once someone earns more than about $130,000 a year, the money they make beyond that isn't subject to the Social Security tax.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.051813,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.00255
    },
    {
      "index": 50,
      "start": 204.2,
      "end": 206.2,
      "text": "It's capped.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.051813,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.00255
    },
    {
      "index": 51,
      "start": 206.2,
      "end": 210.2,
      "text": "That means the rich pay a really small portion of their income toward payroll taxes.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.051813,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.00255
    },
    {
      "index": 52,
      "start": 210.2,
      "end": 213.2,
      "text": "And poor people in the middle class pay way more.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.051813,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.00255
    },
    {
      "index": 53,
      "start": 213.2,
      "end": 218.2,
      "text": "Add payroll taxes onto this chart, and it starts to flatten out.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.051813,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.00255
    },
    {
      "index": 54,
      "start": 218.2,
      "end": 224.86,
      "text": "The last type of taxes we're going to look at are the taxes we pay when we buy stuff.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.048727,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.008316
    },
    {
      "index": 55,
      "start": 224.86,
      "end": 226.86,
      "text": "For example, let's say you're looking to buy a t-shirt.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.048727,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.008316
    },
    {
      "index": 56,
      "start": 226.86,
      "end": 230.86,
      "text": "When you check out, you pay a sales tax, which is a percentage of its cost.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.048727,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.008316
    },
    {
      "index": 57,
      "start": 230.86,
      "end": 233.86,
      "text": "And sales taxes apply to most things.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.048727,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.008316
    },
    {
      "index": 58,
      "start": 233.86,
      "end": 236.86,
      "text": "Furniture, toilet paper, laundry detergent.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.048727,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.008316
    },
    {
      "index": 59,
      "start": 236.86,
      "end": 244.86,
      "text": "For some items like beer and gasoline, there are additional taxes that get incorporated into the price tag before you even get to the store.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.048727,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.008316
    },
    {
      "index": 60,
      "start": 244.86,
      "end": 246.86,
      "text": "These are called consumption taxes.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.04174,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.035126
    },
    {
      "index": 61,
      "start": 246.86,
      "end": 250.86,
      "text": "And we all pay the same rate on the things we buy, regardless of how rich we are.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.04174,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.035126
    },
    {
      "index": 62,
      "start": 250.86,
      "end": 254.86,
      "text": "Now, you might think that since rich people usually buy more things and more expensive things,",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.04174,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.035126
    },
    {
      "index": 63,
      "start": 254.86,
      "end": 258.86,
      "text": "they pay a larger percentage of their income toward these taxes.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.04174,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.035126
    },
    {
      "index": 64,
      "start": 258.86,
      "end": 263.86,
      "text": "But relative to how much money they have, the stuff they buy and the taxes they pay on that stuff,",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.04174,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.035126
    },
    {
      "index": 65,
      "start": 263.86,
      "end": 266.86,
      "text": "take up a relatively small portion of their income.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.04174,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.035126
    },
    {
      "index": 66,
      "start": 266.86,
      "end": 271.86,
      "text": "Meanwhile, everyone, even people with almost no money, needs to buy certain basic things to survive.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.04174,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.035126
    },
    {
      "index": 67,
      "start": 271.86,
      "end": 278.86,
      "text": "And for poor people, those basic things and the taxes that come with them cost them almost everything they earn.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.032245,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.00433
    },
    {
      "index": 68,
      "start": 278.86,
      "end": 282.86,
      "text": "So if we chart how much of their income each of these people pays in consumption taxes,",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.032245,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.00433
    },
    {
      "index": 69,
      "start": 282.86,
      "end": 286.86,
      "text": "we can see that poor people pay a much larger portion.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.032245,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.00433
    },
    {
      "index": 70,
      "start": 286.86,
      "end": 294.36,
      "text": "When we put these taxes together, suddenly we see a big change.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.032245,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.00433
    },
    {
      "index": 71,
      "start": 294.36,
      "end": 300.31,
      "text": "The chart shows us that this line from before is a lie.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.032245,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.00433
    },
    {
      "index": 72,
      "start": 300.31,
      "end": 304.31,
      "text": "That America's tax system as a whole isn't very progressive.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.032245,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.00433
    },
    {
      "index": 73,
      "start": 304.31,
      "end": 306.31,
      "text": "Instead, it's mostly flat.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.0501,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.001133
    },
    {
      "index": 74,
      "start": 306.31,
      "end": 311.31,
      "text": "Poor people pay about the same portion of their income in taxes as rich people.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.0501,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.001133
    },
    {
      "index": 75,
      "start": 311.31,
      "end": 316.31,
      "text": "And this guy, this billionaire, is paying a smaller portion than everyone else, even the poorest.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.0501,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.001133
    },
    {
      "index": 76,
      "start": 316.31,
      "end": 320.56,
      "text": "If you just look at certain types of taxes,",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.0501,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.001133
    },
    {
      "index": 77,
      "start": 320.56,
      "end": 324.56,
